# 文本文件统一按文本处理（行尾由 core.autocrlf 策略决定），避免含特殊字节时被误判为二进制
*.md       text
*.txt      text
*.js       text
*.ts       text
*.tsx      text
*.go       text
*.py       text
*.json     text
*.yml      text
*.yaml     text
*.html     text
*.css      text
*.ps1       text eol=crlf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.sh        text eol=lf

# 二进制资源
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.gif       binary
*.webp      binary
*.ico       binary
*.exe       binary
*.dll       binary
*.zip       binary
*.sav       binary
